---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Legal" description="Intellectual property, contributions, trademark and privacy notices for Elliott Wave LLC (elliottwave.studio lab).">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Legal</h1>
      <p class="lede">Intellectual property, contributions, trademarks, and privacy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2 id="ip">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        elliottwave.studio lab is the brand of Elliott Wave LLC. Elliott — Founder of elliottwave.studio lab and Elliott
        Wave LLC — is the sole author of its first-party technology.
      </p>
      <p>
        Elliott Wave LLC, founded and solely owned by Elliott, owns all intellectual property in its projects — the
        open-source projects included — including MOQOM and six10nine: source code, binaries, designs, documentation, and
        inventions. An open-source licence lets you use the code; it does not transfer ownership. Patents pending.
      </p>
      <p>
        Certain components are published as open source, and six10nine as source-available software, under the licences
        stated in their repositories; those licences govern your use of those components. Identified third-party
        components remain the property of their respective owners and are credited in the relevant <code>NOTICE</code>
