      <p>
        Outside contributors sign a Copyright Assignment Agreement, which assigns copyright in their contribution to
        Elliott Wave LLC and grants them a permanent licence back to use their own work for anything. We have contacted
        legal counsel to review the agreement.
      </p>

      <h2 id="trademarks">Trademarks</h2>
      <p>
        MOQOM™, MOQOM Cloud™, six10nine™, 6(78)9™, Unify™, Kalopsia™, Elliott Wave™ and elliottwave.studio lab™, and the
        Elliott Wave logo, are trademarks of Elliott Wave LLC. The ™ symbol marks a claimed trademark; none of these marks
        is registered yet, and ® will be used only once a mark is registered. Other names may be trademarks of their
        respective owners. Please don’t use our marks in a way that suggests endorsement or affiliation without written
        permission.
      </p>

      <h2 id="privacy">Privacy policy <span class="draft-banner">Draft</span></h2>
      <p>
        <strong>DRAFT. We have contacted legal counsel to review this.</strong> This website does not use cookies, does not run third-party
        analytics, and does not ask you for personal information. If you email us, we use your message and address only
        to reply and keep a record of the correspondence.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our hosting provider may process standard request data, such as IP address and user agent, to deliver and protect
        the site. MOQOM services at moqom.cloud are governed by their own terms and privacy policy.
      </p>
      {/* TODO(Elliott/counsel): finalise privacy policy; name the hosting provider (e.g. Cloudflare) and its data retention; add an effective date; add GDPR/CCPA rights language if required. */}

      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p>Legal enquiries: <a href="mailto:hello@elliottwave.studio">hello@elliottwave.studio</a>.</p>
      {/* TODO(Elliott): consider a dedicated legal@ address; LICENSING.md notes the proprietary licence names legal@moqom.cloud, which must exist and belong to Elliott Wave LLC. */}

      <p class="footnote">© 2026 Elliott Wave LLC. All rights reserved. MOQOM™, six10nine™, Unify™, Kalopsia™, Elliott Wave™ and elliottwave.studio lab™ are trademarks of Elliott Wave LLC. Patents pending.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .prose strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .draft-banner {
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin: 0 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
